    <briefdescription>
<para>Singly linked-list node of a <computeroutput><ref refid="class_b_i_basis_1_1_monom" kindref="compound">Monom</ref></computeroutput>&apos;s variable list, with a per-class slab allocator. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><computeroutput><ref refid="struct_b_i_basis_1_1_monom_1_1_vars_list_node_a27e6ebbc6d73553e4cc3ab65c46c45af_1a27e6ebbc6d73553e4cc3ab65c46c45af" kindref="member">Value</ref></computeroutput> is the variable index, <computeroutput><ref refid="struct_b_i_basis_1_1_monom_1_1_vars_list_node_ad94cd89a5774ddecb9cd01102e148e02_1ad94cd89a5774ddecb9cd01102e148e02" kindref="member">Next</ref></computeroutput> chains to the next variable in increasing order. The static <computeroutput><ref refid="struct_b_i_basis_1_1_monom_1_1_vars_list_node_af5f6cdfd3a1cc596fec874e910b5004c_1af5f6cdfd3a1cc596fec874e910b5004c" kindref="member">Allocator</ref></computeroutput> (a <computeroutput><ref refid="class_b_i_basis_1_1_fast_allocator" kindref="compound">FastAllocator</ref></computeroutput> shared across all <computeroutput><ref refid="struct_b_i_basis_1_1_monom_1_1_vars_list_node" kindref="compound">VarsListNode</ref></computeroutput>s) supplies fixed-size slots so new/delete avoid the system heap on the <ref refid="namespace_b_i_basis" kindref="compound">BIBasis</ref> inner loop. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
